# =====================================================
#  CineMatch - Environment Template
# =====================================================
# 1) Copy this file to `.env`:            cp .env.example .env
# 2) Get a free TMDB API key (v3 auth):   https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
# 3) Paste your real key below.
#
# SECURITY NOTES
# - The real `.env` file is gitignored. NEVER commit it.
# - Never share your key in screenshots, issues, or commit messages.
# - CineMatch will run in OFFLINE mode using local dataset data
#   when no valid key is configured.
#
# Delete the placeholder below and insert your own key:
TMDB_API_KEY=your_tmdb_api_key_here